{"id":"n28169-1-7","stage":5,"title":"코치 · 教练","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28169-1-7-1","ko":"다음 주가 시합인데 선수들 상태는 어때요?","zh":"下周就是比赛了，选手们的状态怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주가","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"주：一周，一星期；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26897","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시합인데","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선수들","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상태는","meaning":"状态","explanation":"상태：状态；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"상태","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16489","senseId":"1","lemma":"상태","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"26897","definition":"周一到周日的七天时间。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"e10195a1239fb321","term":"상태","zh":"状态","audio":"/audio/e10195a1239fb321327b.mp3","entryId":"16489","definition":"事物或现象的模样或情况。","pronunciation":["상태"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f38cbcf9aaa7cc3feb9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28169-1-7-2","ko":"코치를 하는 대로 잘 따라오고 있습니다.","zh":"他们都在按照教练的指导认真训练。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"코치를","meaning":"教练，训练","explanation":"코치：教练，训练；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"코치","audio":"/audio/385038341c51bbf4ae94.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28169","senseId":"1","lemma":"코치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대로","meaning":"随","explanation":"대로：随","readings":[{"term":"대로","audio":"/audio/aa5467e15c67a6b0bb65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48415","senseId":"1","lemma":"대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"认真地，谨慎地","explanation":"잘：认真地，谨慎地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"12","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따라오고","meaning":"承袭，遵循","explanation":"따라오다：承袭，遵循；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따라오다","audio":"/audio/a49522a0ed18f8479596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68602","senseId":"3","lemma":"따라오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"385038341c51bbf4","term":"코치","zh":"教练，训练","audio":"/audio/385038341c51bbf4ae94.mp3","entryId":"28169","definition":"指导并训练选手掌握运动比赛的技术或战术。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"aa5467e15c67a6b0","term":"대로","zh":"随","audio":"/audio/aa5467e15c67a6b0bb65.mp3","entryId":"48415","definition":"像某个状态或情况。","pronunciation":["대로"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"认真地，谨慎地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"深入思考而小心地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"a49522a0ed18f847","term":"따라오다","zh":"承袭，遵循","audio":"/audio/a49522a0ed18f8479596.mp3","entryId":"68602","definition":"依照某人的方式、行动、意图等实施。","pronunciation":["따라오다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cb8ce018125dfc8e15d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28169","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他们都在按照教练的指导认真训练。","你听说那对受欢迎的艺人情侣分手了吗？","下周就是比赛了，选手们的状态怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["他们都在按照教练的指导认真训练。","下周就是比赛了，选手们的状态怎么样？","你听说那对受欢迎的艺人情侣分手了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
